  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. Finely chop or crush garlic. Roughly chop red onion.\n• Slice corn kernels off cob. Finely chop tomato.\n• Drain and rinse black beans. Transfer to a bowl and roughly mash.\n• Heat a large frying pan over high heat. Cook corn kernels until lightly browned, 4-5 mins. Transfer to a bowl.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/620db911f28ca6747256ccd1/step-b9c52f2a.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook onion until just softened, 2-3 mins.\n• Stir in beans and cook until softened, 3-4 mins. Add a drizzle of olive oil with garlic, tomato paste and Mexican seasoning and cook until fragrant, 1 min. Stir in the water. Simmer until thickened, 1-2 mins. Lightly mash. Season.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/620db911f28ca6747256ccd1/step-32b2f515.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Arrange tortillas over lined oven tray. Divide bean mixture over half of each tortilla and top with Cheddar cheese. Fold each tortilla over and gently press gently with a spatula.\n• Brush or spray tortillas with a drizzle of olive oil and season with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/620db911f28ca6747256ccd1/step-1483ecaf.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Bake quesadillas until golden and cheese has melted, 10-12 mins. (Place baking paper and a second oven tray on quesadillas if they unfold in the oven.)\n• Meanwhile, add tomato to corn. Stir in white wine vinegar and a drizzle of olive oil. Season to taste.\n• Top quesadillas with sour cream and salsa to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/620db911f28ca6747256ccd1/step-a7d1c2a4.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
